      "side": 1,
      "message": "This writes offset_idx after the lock is released, but smp_store_release(num_hyp_event_mods) already made this slot visible to readers inside the critical section. Can a concurrent __pkvm_sync_ftrace see the new num_hyp_event_mods but read a stale/uninitialized offset_idx here?\n\nIf yes, separate fix of course...",
